  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to address challenges for 3,328 vulnerable people (605 HHs) through:
(i) WASH kits, incl COVID-19 items, for up to 3,328 vulnerable people to support their immediate WASH needs.
(ii) Hygiene and Hydration education /  awareness raising for 3,328 
(iii) Food kits for up to 3,328 vulnerable people to support their immediate food needs for 1 month.
(iv) Health kits for up to 3,328 vulnerable people
(v) Primary medical care for up to 665 vulnerable people to address their immediate medical needs, incl NCD
(vi) Disaster risk reduction items and guidance to create sandbag barricades against future floods</narrative>
  </description>
